    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d47">

                <pb facs="1071" n="913" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg913"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President to the King of Italy</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-04-10"><hi rendition="#italic">April 10,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>My countrymen are deeply impressed with awe and sorrow by the great calamity that
                    afflicts the Italian people in the disastrous eruption of Vesuvius. In their
                    name, and in my own, I tender to Your Majesty and the sufferers heartfelt
                    sympathy.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Theodore
                    Roosevelt.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
